# Final Dashboard

This is the final output of the pipeline — a live dashboard built on top of the data loaded into BigQuery by this pipeline.

It showcases the end-to-end result: from raw API data fetched via RevenueCat and Adjust, transformed and loaded into BigQuery, and visualized as a fully interactive analytics dashboard.

