## What the Dashboard Shows

- **Subscription cohort LTV** — Realized LTV and Proceeds across D0, D7, D30, D90, D180, D365 windows
- **Attribution metrics** — Installs, paid installs, ad spend, impressions, clicks by campaign and adgroup
- **Cohort revenue trends** — Revenue breakdown by country (US, GB, AU, CA) and platform (iOS, Android)
- **Retention & paying users** — Cohort-level paying and retained user counts across time windows
- **Revenue to cost ratio** — Campaign-level ROAS tracking

---

## Pipeline → Dashboard Flow

```
RevenueCat API  +  Adjust API
        │
        ▼
   Python ETL Pipeline
   (parallel fetch, transform, load)
        │
        ▼
   Google BigQuery
        │
        ▼
   Dashboard (visualized output)
```

